      "text": "\u89e3\u65b9\u7a0b\u7ec4\uff1a\na) $\\begin{cases}25x-18y=75,\\\\35x-28y=35;\\end{cases}$\nb) $\\begin{cases}35x=3y+5,\\\\49x=4y+9;\\end{cases}$\nc) $\\begin{cases}2(2x+y-1)=3,\\\\2(2y-x+1)=3;\\end{cases}$\nd) $\\begin{cases}6(x+y)=8+2x-3y,\\\\5(y-x)=5+3x+2y;\\end{cases}$\ne) $\\begin{cases}\\frac{x}{2}=\\frac{y+1}{3},\\\\\\frac{y}{7}=\\frac{x+2}{6};\\end{cases}$\nf) $\\begin{cases}\\frac{y}{2}-\\frac{x+y}{5}=0.1,\\\\\\frac{y}{5}-\\frac{x-y}{2}=0.1.\\end{cases}$",
      "figure_ids": []
    },
    {
